		"description": "<p>You can cast a spell targeting a Soul Touched in Range/Reach regardless of obstructions. When you do this, the spell only targets that Soul Touched regardless of AoE/multi-target and Soul Touched is removed.</p><p>Additionally, you learn how to cast spells from either the Fire or Lightning School. Ruin can deal either Cold or Fire/Lightning damage.</p><hr><p><em>[A] The module asks you to choose the Fire or Lightning school and grants its spells as tiers unlock.</em></p><p><em>[A] Grants Soul Rite: Ruin (Fire) and Soul Rite: Ruin (Lightning) — use one instead of the Cold Ruin when you want fire/lightning damage.</em></p><p><em>[M] Casting through a Soul Touched ignoring obstructions and single-targeting AoE is resolved by hand; remove the target’s mark afterwards.</em></p>",
